  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promote Wellness &amp; Economic Empowerment with Arts</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Healing Hands project provides interpersonal counseling, group talk therapy, psychoeducation resources and specialist referrals through artwork in Dar, Tanzania. Clients learn traditional beading as a skill during counseling sessions. The project promotes the economic growth of trained grandmothers who are implementing psychosocial interventions. Funds raised from the beaded jewelry will help sustain free &amp; accessible mental health services, support, and resources in underserved communities.</narrative>
  </description>
